name: ps_findings_found
dataset: settlement_findings
measure: count
by[1]: agreement_id
comparator: gte
threshold: 1
severity: WARNING
description: "A settlement control raised a finding for an agreement (a variance beyond tolerance, a missing statement, unrated usage or a missing FX rate). It fires once per agreement; the rows name the day, cycle and reason. Runbook: config/runbooks/partner-settlement-runbooks.md."
